      "writtenOn": "2024-07-19T07:50:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@ccross@android.com\n\nI think this isn\u0027t ideal and can be improved. `init_rc` and `vintf_fragments` could be replaced with `required` deps. ex:\n\n```\n// instead of this..\nmodule {\n   init_rc: [\"my_init.rc\"],\n}\n\n// do this\nmodule {\n   required: [\"my_init.rc\"],\n}\n\nprebuilt_etc { // or a new module type if some processing is required\n   name: \"my_init.rc\",\n   src: [\"my_init.rc\"],\n   subdir: \"init\",\n}\n```\n\nWe could perhaps automatically create the prebuilt_etc modules by soong, so that we don\u0027t have to touch many Android.bp files.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1835,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1840,
        "endChar": 79
      },
      "revId": "11915238a58cb10c082d3d524f605bc03d12ed6a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
